--- !u!114 &114036948254962336
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1573364764971327}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1246
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 毋需多言，先把冲虚押入禁制，待本宫去一趟林家了解情况后再做处理，若冲虚真是用邪法亦或是采补之术，后果就不用我多说了。
  description:
