MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1573364764971327}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 1301
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你这徒儿平日里的为人的确没有问题，但吾辈修士谁不是向着长生而去，又有谁甘心苦修数百年后落得个寿终而亡的结局？
  description:
